# P7: the card logos of the plugin synth engines on the Mini Model list and in the patch editor. The card holds pluck.plg and alco.plg with their
# .plgi logos (plus_flows.sh stages them). Instr held + Up x3 picks Synth 1, Menu box 1 opens its parameters, Down steps the Model list from WTFM (Synth 1 of the new project a replay starts)
# to PLK (row 7, after the 7 built-ins), F8 opens the patch editor. plus_flows.sh reads the logo slots afterwards (UISHOT_TRACE_LOGOS): PLK has
# a list and an editor slot in RAM_G, ALCO a list slot.
# Replay: plus_flows.sh mini
title: Plugin engine logos on the Mini (P7)
check: texts
pause: 90ms

wait 1500ms
press Instr
wait 400ms
tap Up x3
wait 300ms
release Instr
wait 600ms
press Menu
wait 400ms
tap Right
wait 300ms
release Menu
wait 1500ms
expect text "Synth 1"
tap Down x4
wait 1500ms
expect text "PLK"
shot logos-list
tap F8
wait 1500ms
expect text "Edit Patch"
shot logos-editor
